{"cues":[{"sectionId":"intro","start":0,"end":54.72},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":55.6,"end":106},{"sectionId":"practice","start":107.4,"end":157.44},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":158.88,"end":207.28}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"intro","start":0,"end":2.48,"text":"現在我們已經能修改內容和外觀，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":2.88,"end":4.8,"text":"接下來要處理網站的互動。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":5.44,"end":9.52,"text":"這一章的目標很具體：使用者按下按鈕後，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":9.6,"end":12.4,"text":"讓主標題顯示 Hello Methelia。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":12.96,"end":14.16,"text":"要做到這件事，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":14.293,"end":16.16,"text":"可以拆成三個步驟。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":16.4,"end":16.8,"text":"第一，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":17.04,"end":19.24,"text":"找到我們要操作的按鈕；"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":19.44,"end":19.84,"text":"第二，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":20.08,"end":23.12,"text":"設定有人點擊時要執行的動作；"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":23.6,"end":24.08,"text":"第三，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":24.28,"end":27.12,"text":"在那個動作裡更新標題文字。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":28.08,"end":33.92,"text":"畫面上的三個名稱就分別對應這些工作：querySelector 用來找元素，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":34,"end":37.36,"text":"addEventListener 用來監聽事件，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":37.6,"end":41.84,"text":"textContent 用來設定元素中的文字。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":42.8,"end":44.16,"text":"先理解這個順序，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":44.36,"end":47.2,"text":"比一次記住整段程式碼更重要。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":47.92,"end":54.72,"text":"請沿著「找到按鈕、收到點擊、改變標題」這條線看一次範例。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":55.6,"end":57.2,"text":"請看老師打開 app."},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":57.467,"end":58,"text":"js。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":58.88,"end":62.92,"text":"範例先找到識別名稱為 hello 的按鈕，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":63.1,"end":65.04,"text":"再監聽它的 click 事件。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":65.84,"end":67.04,"text":"事件發生時，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":67.28,"end":69.84,"text":"大括號中的程式才會執行，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":70.187,"end":72.48,"text":"其中一行會找到 h1，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":72.76,"end":74.96,"text":"並設定它的 textContent。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":75.36,"end":77.2,"text":"我們保留這個流程，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":77.44,"end":81.68,"text":"只把原本的問候文字改成 Hello Methelia。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":82.8,"end":85.88,"text":"接著一定要按一下預覽中的按鈕，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":85.92,"end":87.68,"text":"才能檢查點擊結果。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":88.56,"end":95.76,"text":"這裡和上一章直接改 HTML 不一樣：這一行描述的是事件發生時要做的事，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":96.04,"end":99.6,"text":"不是宣告網頁一開始就要顯示的內容。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":100.4,"end":103.84,"text":"請觀察老師修改後再點擊的完整過程，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":104.24,"end":106,"text":"下一頁換你操作。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":107.4,"end":108.88,"text":"現在請你在 app."},{"sectionId":"practice","start":109.093,"end":112.08,"text":"js 中找到原本的問候文字，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":112.4,"end":114.4,"text":"改成 Hello Methelia。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":115.12,"end":116.88,"text":"只修改引號裡的文字，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":117.36,"end":121.76,"text":"先保留引號、大括號和事件監聽器的結構。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":122.48,"end":123.28,"text":"儲存後，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":123.6,"end":125.92,"text":"實際點擊預覽中的按鈕，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":126.04,"end":128.4,"text":"看看標題是否符合預期，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":128.68,"end":130,"text":"再驗證練習。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":131.04,"end":135.92,"text":"因為上一章的 HTML 標題也可能已經使用這段文字，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":136.24,"end":138.64,"text":"只看畫面上有沒有出現它，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":138.96,"end":141.28,"text":"還不足以確認程式是對的。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":142.08,"end":143.68,"text":"請同時檢查 app."},{"sectionId":"practice","start":143.893,"end":147.84,"text":"js 的事件程式確實包含新的文字，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":148.133,"end":150.72,"text":"而且按鈕仍能正常操作。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":151.52,"end":153.12,"text":"頁面會停下來等你；"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":153.44,"end":154.4,"text":"完成後，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":154.48,"end":157.44,"text":"我們一起把這段事件流程說清楚。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":158.88,"end":160,"text":"請你看著 app."},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":160.267,"end":160.8,"text":"js，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":161.2,"end":164.32,"text":"試著向另一位同學解釋這段程式。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":165.2,"end":167.52,"text":"首先我們選取按鈕；"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":167.84,"end":170.96,"text":"接著登記點擊事件的處理方式；"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":171.68,"end":173.6,"text":"等使用者真的點擊，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":173.92,"end":176.48,"text":"程式才更新主標題的文字。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":177.28,"end":180.64,"text":"這個流程就是許多網頁互動的起點，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":180.96,"end":185.84,"text":"例如展開選單、顯示訊息或切換內容。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":186.56,"end":190.64,"text":"今天我們只完成其中最小而完整的一個例子，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":190.92,"end":193.52,"text":"不需要一次寫出所有功能。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":194.4,"end":199.68,"text":"現在你的網站已經具備內容、樣式和點擊互動。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":200.4,"end":201.28,"text":"最後一章，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":201.36,"end":204.28,"text":"我們會整理檔案、檢查預覽，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":204.42,"end":207.28,"text":"並把這份靜態網站下載保存。"}]}